       "id": "1a.1",
       "text": "Aldan House, a residential building on Cobbett Row in Nerridge, collapsed on the morning of November 3, 2025.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "The collapse extended to the east wing and destroyed the building, and a warning was issued for the surrounding street.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "Injuries were confirmed in Nerridge and 9 people were rescued from the site by the fire service.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "Provincial Urban Search and Rescue deployed to the site, with the cause of the collapse not yet established.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
